"Toggle which taxonomies are used: match_categories, match_cuisines, "
"match_cooking_methods, match_tags, match_diets (default: true)."
msgstr ""
"Activez les taxonomies utilisées : match_categories, match_cuisines, "
"match_cooking_methods, match_tags, match_diets (par défaut : true)."

